LANE lane/compose — THE COMPOSED ARM (apronpop + transect) — MEASURED, STOP at SPJC
====================================================================================
2026-08-21, session 787ac54a.  Base lane/apronpop ea4a1b8; lane/transect's five
commits cherry-picked in order (aa8b74c 2211e61 227e6c8 6a89e8e 77aeac2) as
d475b8e cab5a06 e970025 b62a3a2 94823f7.  ALL FIVE AUTO-MERGED WITH ZERO
TEXTUAL CONFLICTS — the two lanes touch disjoint functions.  The semantic
composition was verified on the artifact, not on the merge: one CYXY sidecar
carries pair_caps 27985 rows WITH the apronpop family tag
([[ll],[ll],budget,'unified:service_junction']), xsection_spans 3105 bound
transects, and band_clamp_nodes together.  Both kill switches default ON.

WHY THIS LANE EXISTS.  apronpop alone RELOCATES airside debt into transverse
(the family owner ruling 2026-08-21 names as the corridor surface's own law and
which main censuses but does not solve).  Under the ruled population the two
changes are halves of one law; this is the composed arm the apronpop lane
recorded as OWED before any merge decision.

